flowchart TD
  S[URL / WeChat / file / RSS] --> C[Capture]
  C --> N[Normalize + canonicalize]
  N --> D{Duplicate?}
  D -- yes --> R[Reuse existing source revision]
  D -- no --> H[Source health + freshness]
  H --> Q[Recoverable queue]
  Q --> T[Research retrieval]
  T --> CL[Claim / evidence ledger]
  CL --> V[Version compare]
  V --> A[Architecture readiness]
  A --> AR[Human review]
  AR -->|accepted| X[Artifact + action receipt]
  AR -->|hold / reject| B[補证 / revise / replay]
  B --> T
  X --> AH[Audit handoff]
